<title>ITALY: Italy has global trade surplus in Aug.</title>
<headline>Italy has global trade surplus in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy had global trade surplus in August, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p> ITALIAN TRADE BALANCE  Aug 96	  July 96	  Aug 95</p>
<p> Amount (lire)	    7.583 trln    +6.172 trln    +5.011 trln</p>
<p> Cumulative yr to date 26.878 trln   +19.908 trln   +15.324 trln</p>
<p>Note: The calculation is based on flows through the financial sector on transactions in excess of 20 million lire.</p>
</text>
